<title>UK: LucasVarity up ahead of analysts meeting.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity up ahead of analysts meeting.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in LucasVarity Plc rose on Tuesday, ahead of an analysts meeting with the management of the Anglo-American engineering group and its first quarter results on Thursday, analysts said.</p>
<p>LucasVarity shares were up 8-1/2p or around four percent to 203p by 0925 GMT, the biggest gainer in the FTSE 100 index, in active trade of just over four million shares.</p>
